<title>MEXICO: Sanborn sets one peso per share dividend.</title>
<headline>Sanborn sets one peso per share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retail chain Sanborn Hermanos SA said on Monday it will pay a dividend of one peso per outstanding share as of March 20.</p>
<p>Sanborn said in a report to the Mexican Stock Exchange that it would pay the dividend upon presentation of coupon number eight, as agreed at a shareholders' assembly on March 12.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9562))</p>
</text>
